# Agent & Frontend Integration Guide: `django-drf-blog-api` (v0.3.2) & `django-social-autoposter` (v0.2.0)

Unified documentation for corporate blog management, company CMS, media library, and **Social Media Auto-Posting** (Facebook, Instagram, Threads, TikTok, X/Twitter, LinkedIn).

---

## 🔒 Authentication & Headers
All POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE endpoints require standard DRF Authentication:
```http
Authorization: Token <your_user_token>
# OR
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_access_token>
```

---

## 📰 Blog & Social Auto-Poster API (`django_drf_blog_api`)

### 1. Blog Articles (`Post`)
* **List Posts:** `GET /django_drf_blog_api/post-list`
* **Detail by Slug:** `GET /django_drf_blog_api/post-list/{slug}`
* **Create Post (Author/Admin):** `POST /django_drf_blog_api/post`
* **Update Post (Author/Admin):** `PUT /django_drf_blog_api/post`

#### `POST /django_drf_blog_api/post` Payload Specification:
```json
{
  "title": "Unlocking Next-Gen Web Development",
  "content": "<p>Full article body HTML content here...</p>",
  "excerpt": "Short summary for cards and social media shares.",
  "category": 1,
  "read_time": 4,
  "pub_date": "2026-10-04T10:00:00Z",
  "featured_media_id": 45,
  "featured_image_url": "https://external.domain.com/image.jpg",
  "magazine_series_id": 2
}
```
> **Note:** Saving a new `Post` automatically dispatches background tasks to format and auto-post the article to Facebook, Instagram, X (Twitter), and LinkedIn based on `.env` configuration.

---

### 2. Social Auto-Poster Logs
* **List Logs:** `GET /django_drf_blog_api/social-logs/`

```json
[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "post": 15,
    "platform": "facebook",
    "status": "published",
    "external_post_id": "109876543210_1234567890",
    "external_post_url": "https://facebook.com/109876543210_1234567890",
    "error_message": null,
    "created_at": "2026-10-04T19:40:00Z"
  }
]
```

---

---

### 3. Magazine Series (`MagazineSeries`)
* **List Magazines:** `GET /django_drf_blog_api/magazines/`
* **Detail by Slug or ID:** `GET /django_drf_blog_api/magazines/{slug_or_id}/`
* **Create Magazine:** `POST /django_drf_blog_api/magazines/`
* **Update Magazine:** `PATCH /django_drf_blog_api/magazines/{slug_or_id}/`

---

## 📢 Standalone Social Media Auto-Poster (`django_social_autoposter`)

A decoupled package for broadcasting posts simultaneously to Facebook, Instagram, Threads, TikTok, X (Twitter), and LinkedIn.

### 1. Direct Compose & Broadcast Endpoint
* **Endpoint:** `POST /social/broadcast/`
* **Payload:**
```json
{
  "title": "Exciting Announcement",
  "message": "We have just released our new platform features! Check it out now.",
  "link_url": "https://example.com/announcement",
  "image_url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/sample.jpg",
  "platforms": ["facebook", "instagram", "threads", "tiktok", "twitter", "linkedin"]
}
```
*(Leave `platforms` null/empty to broadcast to all enabled platforms).*

### 2. Broadcast History & Per-Platform Audit Logs
* **List Broadcasts:** `GET /social/broadcast/`
* **Broadcast Detail:** `GET /social/broadcast/{id}/`
* **Filter Execution Logs:** `GET /social/logs/?platform=threads&status=published`

### 3. Python Service Usage in Any Django App
```python
from django_social_autoposter.services import SocialBroadcastService

broadcast = SocialBroadcastService.broadcast(
    title="Product Launch",
    message="We are proud to introduce our latest updates.",
    link_url="https://example.com/products/item",
    image_url="https://example.com/image.png",
    platforms=['facebook', 'instagram', 'threads', 'tiktok', 'twitter', 'linkedin'],
    source_instance=product_instance  # Generic relation
)
```

---

## ⚙️ Environment Setup (`.env`)

```env
FRONTEND_SITE_URL=https://yourdomain.com

FACEBOOK_AUTO_POST_ENABLED=True
FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID=109876543210
FACEBOOK_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN=EAAG...

INSTAGRAM_AUTO_POST_ENABLED=True
INSTAGRAM_ACCOUNT_ID=17841400000000000
INSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN=EAAG...

THREADS_AUTO_POST_ENABLED=True
THREADS_USER_ID=17841400000000000
THREADS_ACCESS_TOKEN=THQ...

TIKTOK_AUTO_POST_ENABLED=True
TIKTOK_ACCOUNT_ID=your_tiktok_username
TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN=act.example...

TWITTER_AUTO_POST_ENABLED=True
TWITTER_API_KEY=your_consumer_key
TWITTER_API_SECRET=your_consumer_secret
TWITTER_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_access_token
TWITTER_ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET=your_access_token_secret

LINKEDIN_AUTO_POST_ENABLED=True
LINKEDIN_ORGANIZATION_ID=987654321
LINKEDIN_ACCESS_TOKEN=AQX...
```
